  "derived_field_note": "occupancy_upper_bound_waves_per_simd = min(floor(vgprs_per_simd / vgpr_alloc), max_waves_per_simd_hw), where vgpr_alloc = roundup(vgpr_count, alloc_granularity_wave64). It is an UPPER BOUND from the register file only -- it is not measured occupancy, and it ignores workgroup-slot, LDS and barrier limits. A previous version of this file stored this as 'waves_per_simd' WITHOUT the hardware cap, giving 21/21/12 for N=1024/2048/4096, which exceeds what the hardware can hold; @Reviewer caught it."
